  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Sheen Slide In\n\nA title glides in from the right with a long settle while a gradient sheen sweeps through the glyphs.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 2.134 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- An intro title should arrive with momentum: a fast entrance, a long exponential settle and a barely visible creep into center.\n- A colored gradient highlight sweeps once through the glyphs while the title settles.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You want a repeating metallic shimmer loop: use shimmer-sweep.\n- The title should build word by word: use word-push or word-stream.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"Introducing\"\n- exit_at (number, 30-150): Exit at, default 60\n- font_size (number, 12-160): Font size, default 72\n- base_color (color): Base color, default \"#18181b\"\n- sheen_color (color): Sheen color, default \"#4f8ef7\"\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"400\"\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Sheen Slide In\n\n  A title glides in from the right with a long settle while a gradient sheen sweeps through the glyphs.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/Remocn/remocn/blob/126221ae00ba86eb40b65731b125ff398687d3b7/registry/remocn/sheen-slide-in/index.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) 2026 Remocn\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"sheen-slide-in\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"2.134\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    { \"id\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text\", \"description\": \"Title that glides in.\", \"default\": \"Introducing\" },\n    { \"id\": \"exit_at\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Exit at\", \"description\": \"Frame where the title shrinks away (30 fps).\", \"default\": 60, \"min\": 30, \"max\": 150, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"frames\" },\n    { \"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. Longer text shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 72, \"min\": 12, \"max\": 160, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\" },\n    { \"id\": \"base_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Base color\", \"description\": \"Text color once the sheen has passed.\", \"default\": \"#18181b\" },\n    { \"id\": \"sheen_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Sheen color\", \"description\": \"Color of the gradient that sweeps through the letters.\", \"default\": \"#4f8ef7\" },\n    { \"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"400\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"400\", \"label\": \"Regular\"}, {\"value\": \"500\", \"label\": \"Medium\"}, {\"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\"}, {\"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\"}] }\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Sheen Slide In</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          color: var(--color, #18181b);\n          font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, system-ui, sans-serif);\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .ssl-stage {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          display: flex;\n          align-items: center;\n          justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .ssl-box { position: relative; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0; line-height: 1.1; }\n        .ssl-text { font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; white-space: nowrap; }\n        .ssl-base { color: var(--base, #18181b); }\n        .ssl-sheen {\n          position: absolute; inset: 0; color: transparent; opacity: 0;\n          -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;\n          background-size: 250% 100%; background-position: 160% 50%;\n        }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"sheen-slide-in\" data-duration=\"2.134\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"ssl-clip\" class=\"ssl-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"2.134\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"ssl-box\" class=\"ssl-box\">\n            <span id=\"ssl-base\" class=\"ssl-text ssl-base\"></span>\n            <span id=\"ssl-sheen\" class=\"ssl-text ssl-sheen\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars =\n              window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables\n                ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables()\n                : {};\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function pick(value, list, fallback) {\n              return list.indexOf(String(value)) >= 0 ? String(value) : fallback;\n            }\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            function bz(id, a, b, c, d) {\n              return CustomEase.create(\"ssl-\" + id, \"M0,0 C\" + a + \",\" + b + \" \" + c + \",\" + d + \" 1,1\");\n            }\n            // interpolate(frame, [a, b], [from, to], { easing }) as a tween (frames at 30 fps).\n            function tw(tl, el, from, to, a, b, ease, keep) {\n              var t = Object.assign({}, to, { duration: (b - a) / 30, ease: ease || \"none\", immediateRender: !keep });\n              tl.fromTo(el, from, t, a / 30);\n            }\n            // Shrink an element's font size so it fits a fraction of the frame width.\n            function fit(el, size, frac) {\n              el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              var maxWidth = Math.max(1, root.clientWidth * frac);\n              if (el.scrollWidth > maxWidth) {\n                size = Math.max(12, size * (maxWidth / el.scrollWidth));\n                el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              }\n              return size;\n            }\n            var TOTAL = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"2.134\");\n            function finish(tl) {\n              if (tl.duration() < TOTAL) tl.to({}, { duration: TOTAL - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"sheen-slide-in\"] = tl;\n            }\n            var text = str(vars.text, \"Introducing\");\n            var weight = pick(vars.font_weight, [\"400\", \"500\", \"600\", \"700\"], \"400\");\n            var exitAt = num(vars.exit_at, 60, 30, 150);\n            var base = str(vars.base_color, \"#18181b\");\n            var sheenColor = str(vars.sheen_color, \"#4f8ef7\");\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--base\", base);\n            var box = document.getElementById(\"ssl-box\");\n            var baseEl = document.getElementById(\"ssl-base\");\n            var sheen = document.getElementById(\"ssl-sheen\");\n            box.style.fontWeight = weight;\n            baseEl.textContent = text;\n            sheen.textContent = text;\n            sheen.style.backgroundImage = \"linear-gradient(100deg, transparent 25%, \" + sheenColor + \" 50%, transparent 75%)\";\n            var size = fit(box, num(vars.font_size, 72, 12, 160), 0.8);\n            // Leave room for the 1.8 em the title travels in from.\n            if (size * 2.1 + box.scrollWidth > root.clientWidth) {\n              size = Math.max(12, size * (root.clientWidth - 0) / (size * 2.1 + box.scrollWidth));\n              box.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n            }\n\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            // Exponential settle plus a slow creep, as a function of the frame.\n            var P = { f: 0 };\n            function apply() {\n              var f = P.f;\n              var em = 1.8 * Math.exp(-f / 2.5) + 0.28 * Math.exp(-f / 12);\n              box.style.transform = \"translate(\" + size * em + \"px, 0)\";\n            }\n            apply();\n            tl.to(P, { f: exitAt + 4, duration: (exitAt + 4) / 30, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: apply }, 0);\n            tw(tl, box, { opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1 }, 0, 4);\n            var sheenEase = bz(\"sheen\", 0.42, 0, 0.58, 1);\n            tw(tl, sheen, { backgroundPosition: \"160% 50%\" }, { backgroundPosition: \"-60% 50%\" }, 0, 48, sheenEase);\n            tw(tl, sheen, { opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1 }, 0, 4);\n            tw(tl, sheen, { opacity: 1 }, { opacity: 0 }, 48, 58, null, true);\n            tw(tl, box, { scale: 1 }, { scale: 0.9 }, exitAt, exitAt + 4, bz(\"exit\", 0.5, 1, 0.89, 1), true);\n            tl.set(box, { visibility: \"hidden\" }, (exitAt + 4) / 30);\n            finish(tl);\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
